{"title":"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/9/009cf3eeb0ff3789cc057632947cadb200ab4663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" /> is defined as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/c/26c927f84615ec6305de2fda90a13a21d82f57ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\triangle b = 3a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/8/578df9309aba9271bcc2eda5416ae059b74f8ed8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\triangle 5 = 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"18\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the definition of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/1/6e1fdd7ee397abf4306733b6ebe660171345af93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\triangle b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/8/578df9309aba9271bcc2eda5416ae059b74f8ed8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\triangle 5 = 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/c/17cf679830e673565606fc19ac5232fd86b9f3e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a + 5 = 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/9/b69dbb0d8c7a5e61f8cafca00fac797beca77166.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a = 26 - 5 = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/a/9ba14a8f1f78e5d646bdcb73de8f9852041352ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{21}{3} = \\boxed{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC\">2025 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=